	measure '_Gross Margin % Perc Min per item' = ```


		VAR __MIN_Per_Item =
		    MIN (
		        MINX (
		            ALLSELECTED ( DIM_Customers[Customer_Name]),
		            [_Gross Margin % Perc]
		        ),
		        0
		    )

		VAR __Multiplier =  1.15
		VAR __Result =      __MIN_Per_Item * __Multiplier

		RETURN
		    __Result
		```
