	measure '_Quadrant Filter' = ```


		VAR __Quadrant_Category_ID =          VALUES ( 'TBL Segment | Quadrant | Short'[ID] )
		VAR __Quadrant_Category_Is_Filtered = ISCROSSFILTERED ( 'TBL Segment | Quadrant | Short'[ID] )
		VAR __Quadrant_Item_ID =             [_Quadrant Per Customer | ID]

		VAR __Result =
		    SWITCH (
		        TRUE(),
		            NOT ( __Quadrant_Category_Is_Filtered ), 1,
		            __Quadrant_Item_ID IN __Quadrant_Category_ID,
		            1,
		            0
		    )

		RETURN __Result
		```
		formatString: 0
		displayFolder: Segmentation & Ranking\04. Quadrant\03. Quadrant Logic - Basic (Based on Main Dim)
		lineageTag: 2ef7f88f-d30c-4ed4-8bd7-21986de3272c

