	measure '_Revenue Variance rel. PY' = ```


		VAR __AC_Value = [_Revenue]
		VAR __PY_Value = [_Revenue PY]

		VAR __Check = 
		    ISBLANK ( __AC_Value ) || 
		    ISBLANK ( __PY_Value ) ||
		    __AC_Value <= 0 || 
		    __PY_Value <= 0

		VAR __Relative_Variance = 
		    DIVIDE ( 
		        __AC_Value - __PY_Value,
		        __PY_Value
		    )

		VAR __Result =
		    SWITCH (
		        TRUE(),
		           __Check, BLANK(),
		           __Relative_Variance
		    )

		RETURN __Result
		```
		formatString: +0.0%;-0.0%;0
		displayFolder: 02. Base Variants\01.Revenue\04. Variances
		lineageTag: ef4476e9-ac35-4ed0-9b1c-ab9862861582

