	measure '_Customer Count InScope' = ```


		VAR __Customer_in_scope = 
		    ISINSCOPE ( DIM_Customers[Customer_Name] ) || 
		    ISINSCOPE ( DIM_Customers[Customer_ID] )

		VAR __Customer_count = 
		    DISTINCTCOUNT ( DIM_Customers[Customer_ID] )

		VAR __Result = 
		    SWITCH (
		        TRUE(),
		            NOT ( __Customer_in_scope ), __Customer_count,
		            BLANK()
		    )

		RETURN __Result
		            
		```
