	measure '_Revenue Check Value Matrix Customer | Quarterly' = ```


		VAR __Table =
		CALCULATETABLE (
		    FILTER ( 
		        SUMMARIZECOLUMNS ( 
		            'Dim_Calendar'[Start of Quarter],
		            DIM_Customers[Customer_Name],
		            "@Revenue", [_Revenue]
		        ),
		        NOT ISBLANK ( [@Revenue] )
		    ),
		    ALLSELECTED()
		)

		VAR __Min_Value =       MINX ( __Table, [@Revenue] )
		VAR __Max_Value =       MAXX ( __Table, [@Revenue] )
		VAR __Current_Value =   [_Revenue]
		 
		VAR __Result =   
		    SWITCH (
		        TRUE(),
		            __Current_Value =  __Max_Value , 1,
		            __Current_Value =  __Min_Value , 2,
		            0
		    )

		RETURN __Result

		```
		formatString: 0
		displayFolder: Markers & Data Points & Factors\01. Data Points (Markers)\04. Two Dimensional Min & Max\02. Tag & Color CF
		lineageTag: 065a312a-67de-441e-84fc-08db6ac87277

