	measure '_Gross Profit LTM Based on Date | Datesinperiod' = ```


		VAR __EndMonth =
		    MAX ( 'Dim_Calendar'[Date] )     

		VAR __Result =
		    CALCULATE (
		        [_Gross Profit] , 
		        DATESINPERIOD (                                       
		            'Dim_Calendar'[Date],
		            __EndMonth   ,
		            -12 ,
		            MONTH
		        )
		    )

		RETURN __Result

